const sentences=[
['When Sonja Detrinidad opened her online shop selling houseplants, she didn’t have high hopes for it.','索尼娅·德特里尼达德开设销售室内植物的网店时，并没有对它抱很高的期望。'],
['But the opposite happened: She was flooded, shipping out 1,200 orders in June of 2020 alone.','但实际情况恰恰相反：订单大量涌来，仅在2020年6月，她就发出了1200份订单。'],
['In the past year, Detrinidad sent out more than 70,000 plants.','在过去一年里，德特里尼达德寄出了七万多株植物。'],
['Her success is just one example of increased time at home leading to an explosion in the houseplant industry.','居家时间增加推动了室内植物行业的迅猛发展，她的成功只是其中一个例子。'],
['“Plants are in fashion right now,” says Dr. Melinda Knuth, a researcher from the University of Florida.','佛罗里达大学的研究人员梅琳达·克努特博士说：“现在养植物很流行。”'],
['“People who live in plant-rich environments report a higher life satisfaction rating,” she says.','她说：“生活在绿植丰富的环境中的人，对生活满意度的评分更高。”'],
['“Adding more nature to our environment can change our mood and how we think.”','“在我们的环境中增添更多自然元素，能够改变我们的心情和思维方式。”'],
['Plants can improve our state of mind in a few ways but the biggest is by decreasing our level of cortisol, the stress hormone(激素)in our body.','植物可以通过几种方式改善我们的心境，但最主要的作用是降低我们体内压力激素——皮质醇的水平。'],
['“Students who are around plants perform better academically than students who are in a classroom without plants,” says Knuth.','克努特说：“与待在没有植物的教室里的学生相比，身边有植物的学生在学业上表现得更好。”'],
['“This productivity also translates into the workplace for adults.','“这种效率的提高也同样体现在成年人的工作场所中。'],
['Our study showed that there was a 30% decrease in sick leave for people who were in plant-rich workplaces.”','我们的研究表明，在绿植丰富的工作场所工作的人，其病假减少了30%。”'],
['If you’re among the groups of people who are enjoying the mental and physical health benefits of surrounding yourself with plants, don’t beat yourself up if one (or a few!) doesn’t make it.','如果你也属于从身边的植物中获得身心健康益处的人群，那么即使有一株（或几株！）没能存活，也不要自责。'],
['“Doctors practice medicine and lawyers practice law and you should allow yourself the practice it takes to sustain a plant.','“医生需要行医实践，律师需要法律实践；你也应该允许自己通过练习，逐渐学会把一株植物养活。'],
['Tending to plants is an exercise in patience and learning.','照料植物是锻炼耐心和不断学习的过程。'],
['Be invested in taking care of it, but if it dies, go get another one,” Detrinidad says.','德特里尼达德说：“要用心照料它；但如果它死了，就再找一株吧。”']
].map(([text,translation])=>({text,translation}));
